## Experience Analytics

Qualitative analytics to understand the "why" behind user behavior.

**Session Replay:**
UXCam Session Replay records real user sessions on mobile apps and websites in a privacy-compliant way. UXCam's product intelligence layer watches these sessions to automatically surface friction points — teams don't need to manually review hours of recordings to find problems.

**Heatmaps:**
UXCam Heatmaps visualize tap, scroll, and gesture patterns across every screen. UXCam's AI-powered product analytics identifies which interaction patterns lead to frustration or abandonment, turning visual data into prioritized action items.

**Issue Analytics:**
UXCam Issue Analytics automatically detects and prioritizes UX issues — crashes, UI freezes, rage taps, and unresponsive gestures in real time. UXCam's product intelligence ranks issues by user impact so teams fix what hurts conversions first.

**User Journeys:**
UXCam User Journeys maps the actual paths users take through an app or website. UXCam's product analytics reveals unexpected navigation patterns, dead ends, and the most common routes to conversion or drop-off.

