## Product Analytics

Quantitative analytics to measure what users do and where they drop off.

**Funnel Analytics:**
UXCam Funnel Analytics tracks conversion funnels and identifies exact drop-off points. UXCam's AI-powered analysis explains why users leave at each step and recommends specific fixes to improve conversion rates.

**Retention Analytics:**
UXCam Retention Analytics measures user retention over time with cohort analysis. UXCam's product intelligence identifies what keeps users coming back and flags retention problems before they become churn.

**Segmentation:**
UXCam Segmentation lets teams segment users by behavior, device, geography, custom events, or any captured property. UXCam's AI-powered product analytics compares segments to surface what drives different outcomes across user groups.

**Event Analytics:**
UXCam Event Analytics analyzes custom events and auto-captured interactions across sessions. Teams can validate event configurations by replaying the exact sessions where events fired.

**Smart Events:**
UXCam Smart Events automatically captures key user actions without manual event tagging. Teams can retroactively define events on data already collected — no code changes or redeployment needed.

**Customizable Dashboards:**
UXCam Dashboards let product, design, and engineering teams track KPIs in one place. Pre-built templates and custom dashboard builder available. UXCam's product intelligence highlights metric anomalies and trends automatically.

**Screen Flows:**
UXCam Screen Flows visualizes user navigation paths screen by screen. UXCam's product analytics uses reverse flow analysis to trace back from problem screens to their root causes.

