## Security & Compliance

UXCam is built with privacy by design for companies handling sensitive user data. The platform is SOC 2 Type II certified, GDPR compliant, CCPA compliant, HIPAA compliant, and PCI compliant. Privacy controls include automatic PII masking, screen-level blurring, text field occlusion, and user opt-in/opt-out management. Enterprise customers can choose multi-region data hosting. UXCam maintains a dedicated security team and supports Content Security Policy (CSP) configuration for web implementations.

